## 6. Business Rules

- BRL-01: AI-generated clinical notes shall remain drafts until reviewed and approved through the required workflow.
- BRL-02: The scribe shall correct documentation mistakes in the AI-generated draft.
- BRL-03: The doctor shall review the corrected note and check its clinical accuracy.
- BRL-04: The doctor shall approve the note before finalization.
- BRL-05: The system shall not silently finalize or sign a note on behalf of the doctor.
- BRL-06: The correct patient and encounter shall be verified before the note is saved.
- BRL-07: The system shall not report successful saving unless success is confirmed.
- BRL-08: Only authorized users shall access protected patient information.

